@SagaOutBoxCleanArch.Orchestrator_HostAddress = http://localhost:5250
@sagaId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Get Saga Status by Saga ID (returns saga instance, status, and completed steps)
GET {{SagaOutBoxCleanArch.Orchestrator_HostAddress}}/api/sagas/{{sagaId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Check (Orchestrator)
GET {{SagaOutBoxCleanArch.Orchestrator_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

